WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Type mvm and press TAB

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
① TAB opens a menu → pick up, press Enter

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
MicroVM boots (~15 s, cut from the recording)

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
② You are in the VM, repo already cloned to ~/work

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Linux arm64 with Claude Code preinstalled

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
③ Claude on Bedrock just works (no API key)

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
exit brings you back to your Mac

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.000
④ mvm stop TAB: see what Enter will do first

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Suspended

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.000
⑤ Pick the VM by repo name → only actions that fit

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Resumed, RUNNING again

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
⑥ rm always asks before terminating

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:54.200
From start to cleanup, all with TAB

